  trigger = how do i get to the park
  reply = Follow the burnt-coffee smell east, that's Theo. The plaza's the noisy bit in the middle. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = Police station's across the road, you can't miss it. Everything else is downhill from my door. [[MOOD: neutral]]
  reply = Out my door, past the smell of the fountain, and keep going till the pigeons get rude. [[MOOD: happy]]
  reply = Head toward the middle of town, love. If you hit good coffee, you've gone too far — that's not Theo's. [[MOOD: happy]]
